  "description": "** THIS PRINTABLE IS FOR DOWNLOAD ONLY | **\n❤️B5 format Task Printable Stickers\n-You receive the kit as PDF Files and JPG Files\n-stickers to enhance your Scrapbook Stickers,Stickers Decorative,Planner,bullet journal,Memory,book,Diary book,Travelers Notebook.\n-Different sizes and varieties of tags, washi tape, polaroids, artwork , decors.\n❤️Some important information\n-These are digital files , No physical items will be shipped !! *\n-The color displayed on your screen may vary slightly according to the actual printing.\n-The colors and the quality of the print may be different, depending on the monitor and printer you use.\n-You can print many times you want\n❤️How to Use and print your files\n-You receive the kit as PDF Files and JPG Files\n-JPG Files – Can be used for Digital (You should have the ability to use a digital file editor.)\n-PDF Files – Can be used for Print (recommended to print in full page.)\n-when you print the PDF be sure to print at 100% or actual size.\n-Print on plain paper Or sticker paper Then cut or glue them in your notebook.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>** THIS PRINTABLE IS FOR DOWNLOAD ONLY | **</p>\n<p>❤️B5 format Task Printable Stickers<br>\n-You receive the kit as PDF Files and JPG Files<br>\n-stickers to enhance your Scrapbook Stickers,Stickers Decorative,Planner,bullet journal,Memory,book,Diary book,Travelers Notebook.<br>\n-Different sizes and varieties of tags, washi tape, polaroids, artwork , decors.</p>\n<p>❤️Some important information<br>\n-These are digital files , No physical items will be shipped !! *<br>\n-The color displayed on your screen may vary slightly according to the actual printing.<br>\n-The colors and the quality of the print may be different, depending on the monitor and printer you use.<br>\n-You can print many times you want</p>\n<p>❤️How to Use and print your files<br>\n-You receive the kit as PDF Files and JPG Files<br>\n-JPG Files – Can be used for Digital (You should have the ability to use a digital file editor.)<br>\n-PDF Files – Can be used for Print (recommended to print in full page.)<br>\n-when you print the PDF be sure to print at 100% or actual size.<br>\n-Print on plain paper Or sticker paper Then cut or glue them in your notebook.</p>",
